@startuml 09-runtime-offre
title Atelier 4 — Vue runtime\nCandidature à une offre, puis question notifiée

skinparam dpi 110
skinparam ParticipantPadding 4
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

actor Client
participant "Angular\nPlateforme" as FE
participant "Gateway\n:8078" as GW
participant "Candidature\nMise en relation" as APP
participant "Question\nMise en relation" as QS
participant "User\nIdentité" as US
participant "NotificationService" as NS
participant "Notification\nSupport :8098" as NT
database "MySQL\noffre" as DB

== Candidature : pas de notification ==
Client -> FE : postuler à une offre
FE -> GW : POST /offer/api/applications
GW -> APP : StripPrefix=1\nPOST /api/applications
APP -> DB : statut PENDING
DB --> APP
APP --> FE : OfferApplicationResponse\n(aucun appel Notification)

== Question : notification du freelancer ==
Client -> FE : poser une question
FE -> GW : POST /offer/api/offers/{id}/questions
GW -> QS : addQuestion(offerId, clientId, request)
QS -> DB : enregistre OfferQuestion
QS -> NS : createNotification(\nfreelancerId, NEW_QUESTION, ...)
NS -> NT : POST /api/notifications
NT --> NS : notification créée
QS -> US : UserFeignClient.getUserById
US --> QS : e-mail du freelancer
QS -> QS : EmailService.sendNewQuestionEmail\n(asynchrone ; hôte défaut smtp.gmail.com)
QS --> FE : 201 OfferQuestionResponse
FE --> Client : question envoyée

@enduml
